   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Progress Toward Outcome: On June 28, 2024, the Ministry of Finance has notified ADB of its intention to cancel three projects, including Loan 4081-TIM: Water Supply and Sanitation Investment Project. In Dec 2024, following government review on the project, the Council of Ministers decided to authorize the Minister of Finance and the Minister of Public Works to renegotiate with the Asian Development Bank (ADB) the scope of the loan to finance the construction of drinking water supply and sanitation systems in Lospalos, at an estimated cost of $22.48 million, and in Same, at an estimated cost of $20.59 million. ADB team will further discuss with the government on the next steps and necessary actions while the tender for the civil works package is on-going.</narrative>
    </title>
